        "response": "[Awaiting tool approval]\n\n**Policy:** Shell command approval (skills demo)\nAbout to run a shell command in the agent workspace. Approve to continue?\n**Required Tools:** run_command\n```python\ncontent = await read_file(\"data/sales_q3.csv\")\nprint(content[:2000])\n\nfiles = await list_files(\"data\")\nprint(files)\n\nlisting = await list_files(\".\")\nprint(listing)\n\nlisting_deep = await search_files(\".\", \"**/*.csv\")\nprint(listing_deep)\n\nall_files = await search_files(\".\", \"**/*\")\nprint(all_files)\n\nscript_content = \"\"\"\\\nimport csv\nimport sys\n\ninput_path = \"data/sales_q3.csv\"\noutput_path = \"data/won_deals_q3.csv\"\n\ntry:\n    with open(input_path, newline=\"\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as infile:\n        reader = csv.DictReader(infile)\n        fieldnames = reader.fieldnames\n\n        # Find the status/stage column (case-insensitive)\n        status_col = None\n        for col in fieldnames:\n            if col.strip().lower() in (\"status\", \"stage\", \"deal_status\", \"deal stage\", \"outcome\"):\n                status_col = col\n                break\n\n        if status_col is None:\n            print(\"Available columns:\", fieldnames)\n            sys.exit(\"ERROR: Could not find a status/stage column. Please check the CSV headers.\")\n\n        won_rows = []\n        total = 0\n        for row in reader:\n            total += 1\n            if row[status_col].strip().lower() in (\"won\", \"closed won\", \"closed-won\"):\n                won_rows.append(row)\n\n    with open(output_path, \"w\", newline=\"\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as outfile:\n        writer = csv.DictWriter(outfile, fieldnames=fieldnames)\n        writer.writeheader()\n        writer.writerows(won_rows)\n\n    print(f\"Done! Extracted {len(won_rows)} won deals out of {total} total rows.\")\n    print(f\"Saved to: {output_path}\")\n\nexcept FileNotFoundError:\n    sys.exit(f\"ERROR: File not found at '{input_path}'. Please place your CSV there and re-run.\")\n\"\"\"\n\nresult = await write_file(\"./extract_won_deals.py\", script_content)\nprint(result)\n\nrun_result = await run_command(\"python ./extract_won_deals.py\")\nprint(run_result)\n```",
